{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1083212-how-life-long-titles-work-on-the-invictus","id":1083212,"title":"How \"life-long\" titles work on the Invictus?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-24T16:06:02-07:00","id":1083212,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> How \"life-long\" titles work on the Invictus?","content":"Hello everyone, i am reading the invictus book and got a question on titles.<br /> <br /> The book says that titles of tribute that some are not only lifelong but that only 1 vampire holding the title can exist in a Invictus domain and some make sense for that for example the title of Duke/Duchess which is given to a vampire who find and/or secures a city for the Invictus and a Marquis/Marquise who is given a title for doing something that altered the history of the invictus for the better.<br /> <br /> I get why those are unique as 2 vampires consecutively changing the history of the invictus on the same city are rare.<br /> <br /> However there are some titles that are confusing as to why are 1 per city. Viscount is given to a vampire for being given permanent residence of a domain of the invictus which is weird as that could happen more than one time.<br /> <br /> And the most jarring is the Earl title which is given to a vampire for securing a territory from another covenant for the Invictus, which one would think that when the covenant goes to war and win that happens a lot. Why is 1 per city for something that is relatively easy?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T16:18:02-07:00","id":1083216,"title":"","content":"If I'm reading correctly, earl and viscount aren't per city, they're per domain, which there can be multiple of in a large city . That is, if you are viscount of Soho (to use the book's example), I can't also be the viscount of Soho, but I <i>can</i> be the viscount of Paddington or Highgate without sending the invictus of London into a panic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12109-urbenmyth","name":"Urbenmyth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"166"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T19:06:59-07:00","id":1083265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Urbenmyth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1083212-how-life-long-titles-work-on-the-invictus?p=1083216#post1083216\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I'm reading correctly, earl and viscount aren't per city, they're per domain, which there can be multiple of in a large city . That is, if you are viscount of Soho (to use the book's example), I can't also be the viscount of Soho, but I <i>can</i> be the viscount of Paddington or Highgate without sending the invictus of London into a panic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahh, that explains it, i was thinking &quot;Domain = City&quot; as Soho is something i though referred to a neighborhood.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}